Body:
I got this using GLM 5.3 Flash + OpenRouter as well: {"code":413,"message":"Downloaded image content cannot exceed 30MB","metadata":{"error_type":"payload_too_large"}}

There must be a way to automatically detect limits and drop older image data from future turns to keep the conversation under the limit. The model can always re-read the image.

It does appear that `/compact` successfully releases the old image data so the conversation can continue.
